│ patch_description        │ Every output so far was flagged as AI, including the casual-sounding ones. Those outputs  │
│                          │ shared the same habits: "Honestly" or "Short answer:" openers, a tidy                     │
│                          │ mechanism-by-mechanism explanation, even paragraphs, and clean, fluent grammar. Some      │
│                          │ posts also failed the task check because they invented personal anecdotes.                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This version pushes the register much further toward fast, informal human typing:         │
│                          │ - **Rhythm and grammar:** run-on sentences joined with "and" or "so", comma splices,      │
│                          │ fragments, lowercase starts in casual kinds, sparse internet shorthand, and filler like   │
│                          │ "like" and "kinda".                                                                       │
│                          │ - **Explanation density:** only the gist plus one detail the writer likes, instead of a   │
│                          │ full chain of causes.                                                                     │
│                          │ - **Banned openers:** the formulaic openers that became AI tells are now explicitly       │
│                          │ disallowed.                                                                               │
│                          │ - **Per-kind guidance:** separate instructions for forum answers, notes, posts, emails    │
│                          │ and rewrites. Posts get a "react, don't narrate fake experiences" rule to fix the         │
│                          │ off-task failures, and notes get "jotted, fragment-heavy" guidance.                       │
│                          │ - **Reasoning budget:** the strict reasoning cap stays, since the previous version had no │
│                          │ empty outputs.                                                                            │
│                          │ - **Task quality:** the rules still require answering exactly what was asked, at about    │
│                          │ the requested length, with no invented facts.                                             │
